    <p class="lead">From a first workshop to a running system: we map your workflow, design the right mix of AI and conventional software, build it in short milestones and keep it running.
      Projects are quoted up front; automation tools we operate for you are billed per use, so you only pay for work actually done.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn primary big">Request a quote</a>
      <a href="/pricing" class="btn big">Services &amp; pricing</a>
      <a href="/portal/login" class="btn big">Customer login</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero-points">
      <li>Free 30-minute discovery call, written proposal within 3 business days</li>
      <li>Fixed-price or time-and-materials, milestone demos, source code handed over</li>
      <li>English and Thai, remote-first, invoices payable by <%= co.PAY.paymentMethods %></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="shot">
    <div class="hero-panel">
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">🤖</span><div><b>AI system design</b><br><span class="muted">Document understanding, assistants on your data, decision support</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">⚙️</span><div><b>Process automation</b><br><span class="muted">Bots for web portals, bulk extraction, Excel-driven workflows</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">🌐</span><div><b>Web &amp; API development</b><br><span class="muted">Portals, dashboards, integrations with ERP, CRM, LINE, payments</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-row"><span class="hp-ic">📊</span><div><b>Data &amp; dashboards</b><br><span class="muted">Pipelines, metering and billing, one source of truth</span></div></div>
      <div class="hp-foot muted small">Typical engagement: 2 to 8 weeks · fixed price · source code handed over</div>
    </div>
