</section>

<section id="services" class="features">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <div class="grid3">
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🤖</div><h3>AI system design &amp; consulting</h3>
      <p>We analyse your processes and design where AI genuinely helps: document understanding, classification, extraction, chat assistants on your own data, decision support.
      Model selection, prompt and pipeline design, proof-of-concepts, cost and risk assessment.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">⚙️</div><h3>Business process automation</h3>
      <p>Software robots that take over repetitive work in web portals and back-office systems: bulk data extraction, scheduled reports, document downloads,
      Excel-driven form filling, reconciliation. Built with dry-run modes and confirmation steps where money or legal filings are involved.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🌐</div><h3>Websites &amp; web applications</h3>
      <p>Corporate websites, customer portals, admin dashboards, booking and e-commerce systems. Responsive, fast, SEO-ready, with hosting, SSL and maintenance handled for you.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🔌</div><h3>API &amp; system integration</h3>
      <p>Connect ERP, CRM, accounting, e-signature, LINE, payment gateways and government e-services. Data synchronisation, webhooks, secure REST APIs for your partners.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">📊</div><h3>Data pipelines &amp; dashboards</h3>
      <p>ETL jobs, databases, reporting and BI dashboards, usage metering and billing systems. Turn scattered spreadsheets and exports into one reliable source of truth.</p></div>
    <div class="feat"><div class="ic">🛠️</div><h3>Maintenance &amp; support</h3>
      <p>Monitoring, updates and bug fixes for systems we built or inherited from other developers. Email support within 1 business day; SLA options for critical systems.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="process" class="how">
  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><b>Discovery</b> — a free 30-minute call or workshop to understand the problem, the people involved and the systems you already use.</li>
    <li><b>Proposal &amp; quote</b> — a written scope with deliverables, timeline and a fixed price (or hourly rate for open-ended work). No obligation.</li>
    <li><b>Build in milestones</b> — short iterations with working demos, your feedback at each step, and a deposit invoice only when you accept the proposal.</li>
    <li><b>Launch &amp; support</b> — deployment, documentation and training, source code handed over, then maintenance or pay-as-you-go operation if you want us to run it.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section id="pricing" class="pricing">
  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <p class="lead">Project work is quoted up front with no hidden costs. Automation tools that we operate for you are billed monthly for the records actually processed.
    All invoices are paid online by <%= co.PAY.paymentMethods %> through <%= co.PAY.name %>, and receipts carry your company name and tax ID.</p>
  <p class="center"><a href="/pricing" class="btn primary">See services &amp; pricing →</a></p>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="faq">
  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <details><summary>Who are you?</summary><p><%= co.PRODUCT_NAME %> is an independent software development and consulting practice based in Pathum Thani, Thailand, operated by <%= co.COMPANY_NAME %>. We work with small and medium-sized businesses, HR and service companies, and agencies that need custom software without a large vendor overhead.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What kind of projects do you take?</summary><p>Anything from a two-week automation script to a multi-month web platform: AI-assisted document processing, bots for web portals, customer portals, dashboards, API integrations and corporate websites. If a task is repetitive and rule-based, we can usually automate it.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How do you charge?</summary><p>Three ways, depending on the work: a <b>fixed price</b> per project (most common), an <b>hourly rate</b> for consulting and open-ended work, or <b>pay-as-you-go</b> for automation tools we operate for you, billed monthly per record processed. See <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who owns the code and the data?</summary><p>You do. Deliverables and their source code are transferred to you on full payment, and any data you share for a project stays confidential and is deleted after the project on request. For metered tools, your business data stays on your own systems; we only receive usage counts for billing. See the <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who issues the receipt?</summary><p>Online payments are processed by <%= co.PAY.name %> as Merchant of Record. <%= co.PAY.name %> issues the receipt, handles sales tax and appears on your card statement. You can add your company name, address and tax ID to every receipt.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Do you work with clients outside Thailand?</summary><p>Yes. We work remotely in English and Thai, meet over video and deliver through your preferred tools. Invoices are in Thai Baht and payable by <%= co.PAY.paymentMethods %>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Is there a contract or minimum commitment?</summary><p>Each project has its own proposal, which you accept by paying the deposit. There is no retainer or minimum term unless you choose a maintenance plan. Pay-as-you-go tools have no monthly minimum; months without usage are not invoiced.</p></details>
</section>

<section class="contactcta">
  <h2>Tell us what you want to automate</h2>
  <p>Email <% if (co.COMPANY_EMAIL) { %><a href="mailto:<%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %>"><%= co.COMPANY_EMAIL %></a><% } %>
     <% if (co.COMPANY_PHONE) { %> · call <%= co.COMPANY_PHONE %><% } %> or <a href="/contact">send us a message</a> (<%= co.SUPPORT_HOURS %>). We reply within 1 business day.</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
